# Per-project / instantiated files -- never tracked in the harness repo.
# Recipients generate these locally (/bootstrap, /on-board); pulls stay clean.
# Patterns are root-anchored so portable content (e.g. harness/templates/
# preferences/) is never caught.
/settings.json
/settings.local.json
/preferences.md
/preferences/
/phase_closing.json
/projects/

# Transient state
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
